<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt adds to 2007 government bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt adds to 2007 government bond.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss government is offering</p>
<p>to add up to one billion Swiss francs to its 4-1/2 percent bond</p>
<p>due in 2007, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT   one bln CHF    COUPON     4-1/2     MATURITY   10.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE   fixed-rate    ISS PRICE  -==.===   PAY DATE   06.FEB.97</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE (UNTIL SALE) 576 917 FUNGIBLE WITH 470 458</p>
<p>Subscriptions close on January 23.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
